<title>USA: BioCryst names new president.</title>
<headline>BioCryst names new president.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioCryst Pharmaceuticals Inc said Thursday that J. Claude Bennett, currently president of the University of Alabama at Birmingham, will become president and chief operating officer of BioCryst, effective December 31.</p>
<p>The company said Charles Bugg, who previously held the positions, will remain as its chairman and chief executive.</p>
